  4. To relink against a modified Horizon SDK checkout, place this mod folder
     inside your modified `horizon` workspace checkout and change the
     `horizon-mod-api` path in `Cargo.toml` to point to that checkout's
     `crates/horizon-mod-api` (or unpack your modified SDK `api-source` into
     `.horizon/sdk/` / serve it via `HORIZON_SDK_BASE`), then run
     `cargo horizon-mod build --wasm`.
  5. At runtime, Horizon dynamically links `mod.wasm` (compiled with
     `-Crelocation-model=pic`) against the game's shared `horizon-wasm-std.wasm`
     module (`cargo horizon-mod wasm-std`).


